 (8640,101,0,553,6,3,0,17,0,0,0,2000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,500,'Rupture','Finishing move that causes damage over time, increased by your attack power.  Lasts longer per combo point:\r\n   1 point  : ${($m1+$b1*1+0.015*$AP)*4} damage over $<dur1> secs\r\n   2 points: ${($m1+$b1*2+0.024*$AP)*5} damage over $<dur2> secs\r\n   3 points: ${($m1+$b1*3+0.03*$AP)*6} damage over $<dur3> secs\r\n   4 points: ${($m1+$b1*4+0.03428571*$AP)*7} damage over $<dur4> secs\r\n   5 points: ${($m1+$b1*5+0.0375*$AP)*8} damage over $<dur5> secs','Causes damage every $t1 seconds.'),
