 (72836,101,0,21,6,140,6,6337,-1,4999999,28,1000,0,0,0,0,0,0,70530,0,3178,'Volatile Ooze Adhesive','The Volatile Ooze Adhesive bonds the target to the Volatile Ooze, inflicting $s1 damage every $t1 sec and rooting the target. The Volatile Ooze will move towards the target, exploding for $70492s1 damage, split among all nearby targets.','Rooted.\r\nInflicts $s1 damage every $t1 sec.\r\nWhen the Volatile Ooze reaches you, it will explode for $70492s1 damage, split among all nearby targets.'),
 (72837,101,0,21,6,140,6,6337,-1,4999999,28,1000,0,0,0,0,0,0,70530,0,3178,'Volatile Ooze Adhesive','The Volatile Ooze Adhesive bonds the target to the Volatile Ooze, inflicting $s1 damage every $t1 sec and rooting the target. The Volatile Ooze will move towards the target, exploding for $70492s1 damage, split among all nearby targets.','Rooted.\r\nInflicts $s1 damage every $t1 sec.\r\nWhen the Volatile Ooze reaches you, it will explode for $70492s1 damage, split among all nearby targets.'),
